1338
01:41:37,840 --> 01:41:41,760
SO OTHER FACTORS RELEVANT TO CONSIDERATION FOR YOU AS YOU MAKE THAT DECISION TONIGHT.

1339
01:41:42,560 --> 01:41:44,320
NUMBER ONE, THE STATUTORY WINDOW.

1340
01:41:44,320 --> 01:41:46,960
IT'S THERE FOR UNRSA 40-13.

1341
01:41:46,960 --> 01:41:50,800
IT PROVIDES A TIMELINE THAT THE TOWNS CAN HOLD THEIR DELIBERATIVE SESSIONS

1342
01:41:50,800 --> 01:41:54,560
ON THE FIRST SATURDAY, AND THE SCHOOL DISTRICT CAN HOLD ITS ON THE SECOND SATURDAY.

1343
01:41:54,560 --> 01:41:56,560
SO BY STATUTE, IT CAN WORK.

1344
01:41:56,560 --> 01:42:01,440
IN REVIEW OF THE LAST THREE YEARS, WE'VE LOOKED AT WHEN THE TOWNS DELIBERATIVE SESSIONS WERE SCHEDULED.

1345
01:42:01,440 --> 01:42:03,280
THEY WERE ALL SCHEDULED ON THE FIRST SATURDAY.

1346
01:42:03,280 --> 01:42:04,960
YOU CAN SEE THAT INFORMATION IN THE TABLE.

1347
01:42:06,000 --> 01:42:08,960
POSTPONEMENTS OF ANY DELIBERATIVE SESSION, FACTOR THREE HERE,

1348
01:42:09,520 --> 01:42:12,000
BY RSA, MUST BE HELD WITHIN 72 HOURS.

1349
01:42:12,560 --> 01:42:16,160
SO THE OLD THINKING THAT I THINK SOME OF THE TOWNS HAD,

1350
01:42:16,160 --> 01:42:18,240
THAT IF YOU HAD IT THE FIRST SATURDAY,

1351
01:42:18,240 --> 01:42:20,880
YOUR POSTPONEMENT DATE WAS THE NEXT SATURDAY,

1352
01:42:20,880 --> 01:42:21,760
THAT CAN'T HAPPEN.

1353
01:42:21,760 --> 01:42:24,000
THAT'S OUTSIDE THE STATUTORY WINDOW.

1354
01:42:24,000 --> 01:42:25,680
IF IT'S HELD ON THE FIRST SATURDAY,

1355
01:42:25,680 --> 01:42:30,080
THE MODERATORS MUST MOVE TO HAVE THAT HAPPEN WITHIN 72 HOURS,

1356
01:42:30,080 --> 01:42:34,080
WHICH PROTECTS THE STATUTORY WINDOW OF BOTH THE TOWNS AND THE SCHOOL DISTRICT.

1357
01:42:34,640 --> 01:42:37,040
WE'VE ALSO ENGAGED THE DISTRICT MODERATOR ABOUT THIS.

1358
