I HAVEN'T HAD ANY FEEDBACK, POSITIVE OR NEGATIVE, FROM THE TOWN OF ACKINSON.

1372
01:43:23,920 --> 01:43:27,920
YEAH, SO FOR PLASTOW, THE ONLY THING THAT THEY WERE OKAY,

1373
